        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can use Thales&#x27; theorem to calculate missing angles in inscribed triangles. For example, consider the figure below. We have a triangle inscribed in a circle, and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: AC]</span> is a diameter. </p>",
            "readable_text": "We can use Thales' theorem to calculate missing angles in inscribed triangles. For example, consider the figure below. We have a triangle inscribed in a circle, and [MATH: AC] is a diameter.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/2973b64b22c0536512fd06614a603caf\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/2973b64b22c0536512fd06614a603caf]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/2973b64b22c0536512fd06614a603caf",
                "alt": ""
              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Because <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle ABC]</span> is an inscribed triangle and its side <span class=\"math\">[MATH: AC]</span> is a diameter of the circle, Thales&#x27; theorem tells us that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle ABC]</span> must be a right triangle.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Because [MATH: \\triangle ABC] is an inscribed triangle and its side [MATH: AC] is a diameter of the circle, Thales' theorem tells us that [MATH: \\triangle ABC] must be a right triangle.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/ab715f13ca2348a840d22f544c2b3e24\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/ab715f13ca2348a840d22f544c2b3e24]",
