        "title": "Finding the Measure of an Angle Inside a Circle",
        "key_prerequisites": [],
        "has_content_in_snapshot": true,
        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find the measure of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\angle{EBC}.]</span></p><div class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ba43afe049b07facd6f3cc85409094c1\"></div>",
            "readable_text": "Find the measure of [MATH: \\angle{EBC}.]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/ba43afe049b07facd6f3cc85409094c1]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/ba43afe049b07facd6f3cc85409094c1",
                "alt": ""
              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we compute</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: m\u2220DAB|= m\u2220DAE + m\u2220EAB; = 21^{\u2218} + 45^{\u2218}; = 66^{\u2218}.]</span></p><p>Notice that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle{ADB}]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle{ACB}]</span> are inscribed in the circle, where the side <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\overline{AB}]</span> is a diameter. Therefore, </p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: m\\angle{ADB}=m\\angle{ACB}=90^\\circ.]</span></p><ul><li><p>For  <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle{ADB}]</span>, we obtain\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: m\u2220ABD|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220DAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 66^{\u2218}; = 24^{\u2218}.]</span></p></li><li><p>For <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\triangle{ACB}]</span>, we have\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: m\u2220ABC|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220CAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 45^{\u2218}; = 45^{\u2218}.]</span> </p></li></ul><p>Finally, </p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: m\u2220EBC|= m\u2220ABC \u2212 m\u2220ABD; = 45^{\u2218} \u2212 24^{\u2218}; = 21^{\u2218}.]</span> </p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we compute\n\n[MATH: m\u2220DAB|= m\u2220DAE + m\u2220EAB; = 21^{\u2218} + 45^{\u2218}; = 66^{\u2218}.]\n\nNotice that [MATH: \\triangle{ADB}] and [MATH: \\triangle{ACB}] are inscribed in the circle, where the side [MATH: \\overline{AB}] is a diameter. Therefore,\n\n[MATH: m\\angle{ADB}=m\\angle{ACB}=90^\\circ.]\n\n- For [MATH: \\triangle{ADB}], we obtain\n[MATH: m\u2220ABD|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220DAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 66^{\u2218}; = 24^{\u2218}.]\n- For [MATH: \\triangle{ACB}], we have\n[MATH: m\u2220ABC|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220CAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 45^{\u2218}; = 45^{\u2218}.]\n\nFinally,\n\n[MATH: m\u2220EBC|= m\u2220ABC \u2212 m\u2220ABD; = 45^{\u2218} \u2212 24^{\u2218}; = 21^{\u2218}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [
          {
            "src": "/graphics/ba43afe049b07facd6f3cc85409094c1",
            "alt": ""
          }
        ],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind the measure of [MATH: \\angle{EBC}.]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/ba43afe049b07facd6f3cc85409094c1]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we compute\n\n[MATH: m\u2220DAB|= m\u2220DAE + m\u2220EAB; = 21^{\u2218} + 45^{\u2218}; = 66^{\u2218}.]\n\nNotice that [MATH: \\triangle{ADB}] and [MATH: \\triangle{ACB}] are inscribed in the circle, where the side [MATH: \\overline{AB}] is a diameter. Therefore,\n\n[MATH: m\\angle{ADB}=m\\angle{ACB}=90^\\circ.]\n\n- For [MATH: \\triangle{ADB}], we obtain\n[MATH: m\u2220ABD|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220DAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 66^{\u2218}; = 24^{\u2218}.]\n- For [MATH: \\triangle{ACB}], we have\n[MATH: m\u2220ABC|= 90^{\u2218} \u2212 m\u2220CAB; = 90^{\u2218} \u2212 45^{\u2218}; = 45^{\u2218}.]\n\nFinally,\n\n[MATH: m\u2220EBC|= m\u2220ABC \u2212 m\u2220ABD; = 45^{\u2218} \u2212 24^{\u2218}; = 21^{\u2218}.]"
      },
