        "readable_text": "Question Graphic:\n[IMG: /graphics/q-53817]\n\nPrompt:\nFind the measure of [MATH: \u2220EBP.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: 40^{\u2218}]\nb. [MATH: 50^{\u2218}]\nc. [MATH: 35^{\u2218}]\nd. [MATH: 20^{\u2218}]\ne. [MATH: 25^{\u2218}]"
